{"displayStem":"적출 평활근에서 작용제 A의 농도에 따른 반응을 측정하였다. Ⅰ은 A 단독, Ⅱ는 약물 B 전처리 후의 결과이다. 각 농도에서 독립적으로 5회 측정한 평균을 연결하였다. 측정의 표준편차는 약 2%p였고 B 단독은 반응을 일으키지 않았다. 충분한 수용체 점유 평형에 도달한 뒤 측정하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"그림은 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 580 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 농도 (상대단위, 로그)와 반응 (%) 비교 그래프\"><path d=\"M60 45V245H520\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M60 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.01</text><path d=\"M210 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"210\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M360 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"360\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><path d=\"M510 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"510\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10000</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"249\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"151.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><polyline points=\"60,244.5125 78.75,241.763 97.5,238.175 116.25,234.50900000000001 135,226.085 153.75,214.83350000000002 172.5,199.1555 191.25,174.8585 210,148.08499999999998 228.75,119.771 247.5,97.15100000000001 266.25,79.4255 285,68.07650000000001 303.75,60.99799999999999 322.5,52.164500000000004 341.25,52.690999999999974 360,51.403999999999996 378.75,51.579499999999996 397.5,50 416.25,52.164500000000004 435,50.389999999999986 453.75,52.0085 472.5,50 491.25,51.033500000000004 510,50\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\" fill=\"none\"></polyline><text x=\"385\" y=\"25\">Ⅰ ━</text><polyline points=\"60,242.66 78.75,245 97.5,239.3645 116.25,243.908 135,241.724 153.75,244.025 172.5,236.2835 191.25,233.417 210,227.099 228.75,217.31 247.5,197.2055 266.25,173.4545 285,149.46949999999998 303.75,121.5065 322.5,96.89749999999998 341.25,77.72899999999998 360,68.05700000000002 378.75,63.00649999999999 397.5,55.674499